  <span class="kicker">Cottage business</span>
  <h1>From hobby batches to a real cottage business</h1>
  <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink-soft);">Freeze-dried candy and snacks are among the most popular cottage food products in the country, and among the easiest to get wrong legally. This hub collects everything we publish on selling what you dry.</p>
  <div class="notice" role="note">
    <strong>Before anything else:</strong> cottage food rules are state law, they vary widely, and they change. Everything here is educational. Confirm your state's current rules with your Department of Agriculture or health department before your first sale.
  </div>
  <h2>Start here</h2>
  <ul class="card-grid">
    <li class="card">
      <span class="kicker">Flagship guide</span>
      <h3><a href="/guides/cottage-economics">Selling freeze-dried food from home: rules, testing, and real unit economics</a></h3>
      <p>What cottage food laws generally allow, the 0.85 water-activity line, labeling, and a worked cost-per-bag model.</p>
    </li>
