      <h3><a href="/tools/batch-log">The Batch Log &amp; Cost Tracker</a></h3>
      <p>Know your true cost per batch and per bag: the number your pricing depends on. Includes a water-activity reading field for your records.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <span class="kicker">Troubleshooting</span>
      <h3><a href="/troubleshooting/storage-failure">Bags lost their crunch in storage</a></h3>
